                <mxCell id="h-title" value="Health Score — Every Component: Modules → Data → Backend Logic → Score&#10;Engine: HealthScoreEngine in portfolio-analytics | API: POST /v1/analytics/portfolio/{id}/intelligence | am-market: NO CHANGE (HTTP client only)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111111;" parent="1" vertex="1">
