                <mxCell id="h-final" value="FINAL HEALTH = Div×0.20 + Conc×0.20 + Perf×0.15 + Vol×0.15 + Liq×0.10 + Beta×0.10 + Alloc×0.05 + Resil×0.05&#10;If history missing → OMIT Vol + Beta, RENORMALIZE remaining weights (never invent). Band = Critical / Watch / Healthy / Strong. Component UI number = 0–100 SCORE (not portfolio %)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c2185b;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
