                <mxCell id="c2l" value="Backend logic → Score 0–100&#10;Higher peak % → LOWER score (amber).&#10;Thresholds (Risk chips): top1≥25% High;&#10;sector≥30% High (e.g. Banking 31.4%).&#10;150 names with one 40% stock still scores BAD." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe0b2;strokeColor=#ef6c00;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
