                <mxCell id="c6m" value="Modules&#10;• Portfolio return series (same as Vol)&#10;• NIFTY via portfolio-market-data&#10;  → am-market-data indices&#10;• am-market NO CODE CHANGE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3949ab;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
